  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "前端函数链",
      "items": [
        "static/app.js：loadInitialData → state.agents → renderWorkspaces；点击 Scholar → selectAgent → renderScholarDashboard → renderScholarFullView。",
        "server.py 的闭包 create_observatory_app 创建 Registry / Storage / Harvester / SSEBroadcaster；这些函数没有伪装成代码类。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "图的代码范围",
      "items": [
        "类图仅覆盖当前 UuMA 源码中 Scholar 的可见集成点。RSTV4 本体不在当前工作区，未虚构 Catalog/Studio 的内部类。",
        "Worker MCP 的 register_direct_run / report_progress / submit_result 调用 ControlPlane；knowledge_runtime_preflight 调用 ensure_knowledge_graph，再配置 ScholarRuntime 并核对独立 ScholarFieldKG。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "依赖不是数据所有权",
      "items": [
        "ScholarAdapter 继承只读源契约；Registry 聚合工作区；Storage 写入的是 observatory.db 缓存，没有写入研究源库。",
        "SourceFreshness 代表可达性与事件时间；不代表科学证据充分、数据新鲜度达标或模型语义已获批准。"
      ]
    }
  ]
